WEBVTT

NOTE The Commons, episode 03. Same words as the captions in the picture.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
[Music]

2
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.750
Sunday dinner for twelve? Easy.

3
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.500
Roast in at eleven, Yorkshires at quarter to two,

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.100
and gravy that’d make you cry.

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.400
Then this lands. An interview.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.100
Apprentice chef. Monday morning.

7
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.400
Cooking, I can do.

8
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.100
Talking about myself for ten minutes?

9
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.100
My brain just goes... blank.

10
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.250
So Priya runs a mock interview.

11
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.500
Across the gravy. She is not messing about.

12
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.750
Her trick? Tell it like a recipe.

13
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.750
What you made. How you made it.

14
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.400
How it turned out.

15
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.000
Monday. Same nerves.

16
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.500
But this time, I had my recipes.

17
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:38.900
Did I get it?

18
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:39.900
Let’s just say...

19
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.900
[Ozzy howls] AWOOOOOO!

20
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.400
Ozzy howled.

21
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:49.700
[Music]
